<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Freedom Furniture yr EBIT A$10.2 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Freedom Furniture yr EBIT A$10.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furniture retailer Freedom Furniture Ltd said on Thursday it had made earnings before interest, tax and abnormals (EBIT) of A$10.2 million for the 12 months to September 30, 1996.</p>
</text>
